SUMMARY:Bent Creek: Lower Sidehill\, South Branch\, 7 miles
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nCraig is taking the day off\, so y
 ou got me. Registration opens today\, Friday\, April 24\, 5 PM.\n\nThis is
  a lovely patch of Bent Creek. It's a spring time walk in the woods. We'll
  stare on Lower Sidehill and hike to Bent Creek Gap Road. Then we'll cross
  over onto the other side of the hollar and hike South Ridge Road. Then it
 s down through the cove forest known as Chestnut to the Explorer Loop park
 ing lot\, with a return on a portion of Lower Sidehill to complete the lol
 lipop.\n\n**Car pool:** I will be at the Outlet Mall **behind behind the W
 affle House**. Look for the 2000 Toyota Tacoma pickup truck. Car pool leav
 es at 9:00 A.M. with whoever is there at that time. For car pool drivers\,
  the trailhead is at the intersection of Bent Creek Gap Road and Forest Se
 rvice Road 479F (Boyd Branch Road)\, which is 1 mile beyond Ledford Branch
  Parking lot. This 1 mile segment is a dirt road. Parking is in a small lo
 t and along the shoulder\n\n**Stats:**\nDistance: approx. 7 miles\nPace: 2
  mph to 2.5 mph\nAscent: approx. 1\,000 feet\n\n**Release of Liability Boi
 lerplate:**\nThe organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not a professio
 nal guide. The function of the organizer is only to organize this trip. If
  you sign up or participate in this event you acknowledge that you freely 
 and voluntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and da
 mages arising from\, as a result of\, and associated with this event. In a
 ddition\, you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup terms: https://www.
 meetup.com/terms
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/314460188
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
