SUMMARY:Scenic AVL #5: Murdock Grove Weaver Blvd Loop
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**Rating**: Moderate\n**Distance**
 : 5 miles\n**Pace**: 3.2 mph\n**Elevation Gain**: 800\n**Surface**: Road\n
 **Dogs**: On leash\n**Wildlife**: Wild Turkey\; not likely to see bears.\n
 \n**Route**: [Murdock Grove Loop](https://www.alltrails.com/explore/map/we
 aver-grove-park-inner-loop-439d8c9?p=-1&sh=ifwm3x)\n\n**Scenic Asheville S
 eries**: There are 9 [hikes in the series](https://docs.google.com/spreads
 heets/d/1XUm-X1_OhxKIi8JU5rhjsW37cAl4yYx8yB_NEjjI5Lk)\; hike them all and 
 receive an attractive badge for your backpack.\n\n**RSVP and On-Time Start
 **:\n*If you must cancel\, please change your status to "Not Going" as soo
 n as possible so wait-listers can have sufficient notice.\n- There are gen
 erally 1 or 2 no-shows on my hikes\, so we don't wait for people to arrive
 . If you are late\, you'll be left behind.\n\nNotes and comments are genui
 nely appreciated.\n\n**Disclaimer and Release of Liability**:\nThis activi
 ty involves hiking on city streets that may have traffic. Participants are
  responsible for their safety on streets and trails. The organizer of this
  trip is a volunteer and not a professional guide. The function of the org
 anizer is only to organize this trip. If you sign up or participate in thi
 s event you acknowledge that you freely and voluntarily agree to assume al
 l risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages arising from\, as a result o
 f\, and associated with this event. In addition\, you acknowledge that you
  agree to the Meetup terms: [https://www.meetup.com/terms](https://www.mee
 tup.com/terms)
